  "step_by_step_reasoning": "The architecture shows an AI conversational engine. External requests enter via Twitter/Web into API Gateway, which forwards to a proxy Lambda function. The Lambda uses Comprehend for translation and Lex for conversation handling. Unresolved queries escalate to SageMaker. Conversation logs are sent asynchronously via SNS to an ingestion Lambda, which writes to RDS and OpenSearch (Elasticsearch). A Team Lead (TL) uses OpenSearch and RDS to monitor responses, supplying feedback to a SageMaker Training model that updates Lex and SageMaker inference models. QuickSight analyzes stored data for business analytics.",
